{"id":"n66012-2-7","stage":5,"title":"시원시원하다 · 开朗","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66012-2-7-1","ko":"소개팅한 남자는 어땠어?","zh":"那次相亲的男生怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"소개팅한","meaning":"相亲过的（修饰后面的 남자）","explanation":"소개팅：相亲；하다：做（소개팅을 하다：相亲）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"소개팅","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64308","senseId":"1","lemma":"소개팅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소개팅한","audio":"/audio/992131a44670ce7e6e8a.mp3"}},{"text":"남자는","meaning":"男子汉","explanation":"남자：男子汉；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"2","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자는","audio":"/audio/40ebb09428b30870bfab.mp3"}},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어땠어","audio":"/audio/fd7f0c90fa72bdb46939.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"eeb441c4ef6cc8bc","term":"소개팅","zh":"相亲","audio":"/audio/eeb441c4ef6cc8bc32cf.mp3","entryId":"64308","definition":"相亲","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（소개팅을 하다：相亲）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（소개팅을 하다：相亲）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子汉","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"力气大、稳重，坚强而尽显男性气概的男性。","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3aca3e1af3d22f3b89d7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66012-2-7-2","ko":"남자답게 활발하고 시원시원한 편이었어.","zh":"他很有男子气概，性格开朗又爽快。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"남자답게","meaning":"有男子气概","explanation":"남자：男子汉（남자답다：有男子气概）；답：表示具有前面名词应有的特征或风范：“有……的样子、不愧是……”；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"2","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자답게","audio":"/audio/9930687fd4a44a157191.mp3"}},{"text":"활발하고","meaning":"活泼，活跃，生龙活虎","explanation":"활발하다：活泼，活跃，生龙活虎；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"활발하다","audio":"/audio/48335158f4584d3f2c1b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73240","senseId":"1","lemma":"활발하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"활발하고","audio":"/audio/b1ed356081450c435aa7.mp3"}},{"text":"시원시원한","meaning":"开朗，爽快","explanation":"시원시원하다：开朗，爽快；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시원시원하다","audio":"/audio/02126264bfac29e1d133.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66012","senseId":"2","lemma":"시원시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원시원한","audio":"/audio/4b9b7ac342f5f3cce749.mp3"}},{"text":"편이었어.","meaning":"算是","explanation":"편：算是；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"편","audio":"/audio/53cb600fa1af07485c60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71321","senseId":"3","lemma":"편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편이었어","audio":"/audio/6db164e7502ba357a4e3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c6a3b6d97217b4d8","term":"남자","zh":"男子汉（남자답다：有男子气概）","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3","entryId":"60865","definition":"男子汉（남자답다：有男子气概）","pronunciation":["남자"]},{"id":"48335158f4584d3f","term":"활발하다","zh":"活泼，活跃，生龙活虎","audio":"/audio/48335158f4584d3f2c1b.mp3","entryId":"73240","definition":"